+## My Tools provider
+
+Uses OpenRouter Decisions API (`typesafe/jev-1.13`) with the same typed score
+contract. Reads `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` from the task environment, or the existing
+private personal Siftr credential when absent. An explicit empty value disables
+that fallback. No session hook or transcript is required. The diff and extracted
+test definitions go to the provider: use only data authorized for that processing.
+The original selection engine, thresholds, fallback and runner argv are unchanged.
